548
00:20:25,920 --> 00:20:26,640
It is true.

549
00:20:26,960 --> 00:20:29,440
Spending so much time with people outside my family,

550
00:20:29,780 --> 00:20:31,680
the Tani from a year ago would be shocked.

551
00:20:32,500 --> 00:20:33,600
Do you prefer this, Tani?

552
00:20:33,600 --> 00:20:38,280
It's not really about which is better.

553
00:20:38,480 --> 00:20:38,780
Really?

554
00:20:39,220 --> 00:20:42,240
Up until now, not very many things bothered me.

555
00:20:43,220 --> 00:20:43,980
It's true.

556
00:20:44,140 --> 00:20:46,240
That's the part of Tani I fell for in the first place.

557
00:20:46,580 --> 00:20:48,000
So stoic, so consistent.

558
00:20:48,820 --> 00:20:50,040
But it's different now.

559
00:20:51,120 --> 00:20:53,420
Today, I have all these uncertainties,

560
00:20:53,880 --> 00:20:55,900
and new worries I didn't have when I was alone.

561
00:20:56,300 --> 00:20:59,160
I'm more confused, but I know a lot more than I used to,

562
00:20:59,460 --> 00:21:01,120
and I'm sure there's still a lot to learn.

563
00:21:01,920 --> 00:21:02,660
But that's good.

564
00:21:02,660 --> 00:21:05,240
I'm glad I don't have to be ignorant anymore.

565
00:21:07,800 --> 00:21:09,440
So neither Tani's better,

566
00:21:09,780 --> 00:21:11,000
because they're both Tani?

567
00:21:11,420 --> 00:21:11,740
Right.

568
00:21:12,180 --> 00:21:13,320
And that's why.

569
00:21:14,240 --> 00:21:15,660
I'm happy I met you.

570
00:21:15,980 --> 00:21:16,480
Thank you.

571
00:21:20,120 --> 00:21:20,640
Ah!

572
00:21:20,900 --> 00:21:21,200
You!

573
00:21:21,640 --> 00:21:22,300
Tani, you!

574
00:21:23,120 --> 00:21:24,980
He's being so sweet and wholesome!

575
00:21:25,220 --> 00:21:26,600
Meanwhile, my mind's been in the gutter

576
00:21:26,600 --> 00:21:28,360
with all my selfish, earthly desires!

577
00:21:29,140 --> 00:21:30,160
I'm so embarrassed!

578
00:21:30,600 --> 00:21:31,480
Forgive me, Tani!

579
00:21:32,660 --> 00:21:45,120
You know I love you.

580
00:21:46,760 --> 00:21:47,520
Right, Yusuke?

581
00:21:47,520 --> 00:21:48,020
Meo.

582
00:21:48,020 --> 00:21:57,560
We do one more time!

583
00:21:57,780 --> 00:21:58,680
We better head back!

584
00:21:59,200 --> 00:22:00,000
Have an awesome night!

585
00:22:00,300 --> 00:22:01,380
Hope the boys don't snore!

586
00:22:03,660 --> 00:22:04,480
Sit her down, girl!

587
00:22:04,700 --> 00:22:05,640
Do not freak out!

588
00:22:05,640 --> 00:22:17,340
You know and behold, there were far more chuckles than snuggles the first night of the trip.

589
00:22:17,700 --> 00:22:19,040
I wonder what'll happen tomorrow.

590
00:22:19,040 --> 00:22:20,620
Don't Aberdeen deserve to be裝ies!

591
00:22:22,960 --> 00:22:23,760
Oh!

592
00:22:23,820 --> 00:22:24,660
Oh!

593
00:22:25,020 --> 00:22:25,320
Okay.

594
00:22:25,480 --> 00:22:25,880
Oh!

595
00:22:34,280 --> 00:22:35,300
Yeah!

596
00:22:35,300 --> 00:23:05,280
We'll be right back.

597
00:23:05,300 --> 00:23:35,280
We'll be right back.

